https://leetcode.com/problems/jump-game/?envType=study-plan-v2&envId=top-interview-150

https://takeuforward.org/Greedy/jump-game-i

class Solution {
    public boolean canJump(int[] nums) {
        int last=nums.length-1;

        for(int i=nums.length-2; i>=0; i--){
            if(nums[i]+i >= last)   last=i;
        }

        return last==0;
    }
}

//basically, we have to check from "element before last index" is able to reach the last index.
//If it is able to reach, define that index as last index and proceed.